    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d40-a1">

                <pb facs="d40-02" n="2" xml:id="d40-02"/>

                <head>Tab A<lb/>Telegram 6431 From the Embassy in the Soviet Union to the Department
                    of State</head>
                <dateline><placeName>Moscow</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1969-11-19T13:30:00+00:00">November 19, 1969, 1330Z</date>.</dateline>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>Subect:</label>
                    <item>Soviet Ratification of NPT
                    </item>
                </list>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Deputy Chief MFA American Section (Zinchuk) called in DCM November 19 to
                        tell us “for information” that Dobrynin had been instructed (a) to inform
                        Secretary Supreme Soviet Premier plans to ratify Non-Proliferation Treaty
                        November 24 and (b) to propose that US and
                            USSR make simultaneous press release
                        same day at 1100 Washington time and 900 Moscow time. In response query,
                        Zinchuk said under Soviet procedure Presidium action would be final step and
                        no signing ceremony would be involved.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Zinchuk requested Embassy inform MFA once we have learned USG reaction.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Dept. inform Helsinki.</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        Beam
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
